olutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017201614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.085 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 264/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4448/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 395/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2737/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.007      1 -total\n 28.26%    8.481      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 26.85%    8.058      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 17.66%    5.298      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n 17.56%    5.268      1 Template:Duplicate\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4234:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017201614 and revision id 195904. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}